    "detailed_description": "You are an orphan. Adopted by a kind and caring healer, you are taught to run the shop. You do your best to help out - learning and becoming a true apprentice - when one day tragedy strikes! And you are forced to run the business yourself... <br><br>Something has happened to that healer now, but can you uncover the truth?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is the Chapter 1: Prologue ============</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Begin your study of the occult<br></li><li>Explore the main mission<br></li><li>Face 1 of 3 different sorcerous battle arenas sampling powerful, elemental sorcery<br></li><li>Uncover a few miss-able side-quests, cutscenes and easter eggs<br></li><li>Offer direct feedback to influence the next chapter of sorcery</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Call Spirit Magic</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/d29ada309ff6747a84dc94d0f7ea0f90.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/d29ada309ff6747a84dc94d0f7ea0f90.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/d29ada309ff6747a84dc94d0f7ea0f90.mp4?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Aid the spirits &amp; gain unique spells and sorceries!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Commune with entities</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/dc93aea9f641737e15c883518d40e2f3.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/dc93aea9f641737e15c883518d40e2f3.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/dc93aea9f641737e15c883518d40e2f3.mp4?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Request help, or incur the wrath of mysterious entities on your journey<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mix Remedies</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/6a08a2b5e3d57d9db1aa32765ba90b2b.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/6a08a2b5e3d57d9db1aa32765ba90b2b.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/6a08a2b5e3d57d9db1aa32765ba90b2b.mp4?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Create mystic remedies through an interactive process. Sell, keep, or barter?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Fate</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/4259983ddd223372a8d015c03758eb2e.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/4259983ddd223372a8d015c03758eb2e.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/4259983ddd223372a8d015c03758eb2e.mp4?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore the mysteries of the Spirit World<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Story ============</h2>This project is an episodic Action-RPG where you play the adopted grandson of a healer woman. <br>She succumbs to a mysterious illness, leaving it up to you to find a way to help her. <br>Run her apothecary and unravel the source of her malady. <br>On this journey you'll befriend powerful spirits and learn incredible sorceries by calling upon them.<br><br>Can you save her?",
    "about_the_game": "You are an orphan. Adopted by a kind and caring healer, you are taught to run the shop. You do your best to help out - learning and becoming a true apprentice - when one day tragedy strikes! And you are forced to run the business yourself... <br><br>Something has happened to that healer now, but can you uncover the truth?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is the Chapter 1: Prologue ============</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Begin your study of the occult<br></li><li>Explore the main mission<br></li><li>Face 1 of 3 different sorcerous battle arenas sampling powerful, elemental sorcery<br></li><li>Uncover a few miss-able side-quests, cutscenes and easter eggs<br></li><li>Offer direct feedback to influence the next chapter of sorcery</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Call Spirit Magic</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/d29ada309ff6747a84dc94d0f7ea0f90.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/d29ada309ff6747a84dc94d0f7ea0f90.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/d29ada309ff6747a84dc94d0f7ea0f90.mp4?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Aid the spirits &amp; gain unique spells and sorceries!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Commune with entities</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/dc93aea9f641737e15c883518d40e2f3.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/dc93aea9f641737e15c883518d40e2f3.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/dc93aea9f641737e15c883518d40e2f3.mp4?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Request help, or incur the wrath of mysterious entities on your journey<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mix Remedies</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/6a08a2b5e3d57d9db1aa32765ba90b2b.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/6a08a2b5e3d57d9db1aa32765ba90b2b.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/6a08a2b5e3d57d9db1aa32765ba90b2b.mp4?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Create mystic remedies through an interactive process. Sell, keep, or barter?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Fate</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/4259983ddd223372a8d015c03758eb2e.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/4259983ddd223372a8d015c03758eb2e.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/4259983ddd223372a8d015c03758eb2e.mp4?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore the mysteries of the Spirit World<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Story ============</h2>This project is an episodic Action-RPG where you play the adopted grandson of a healer woman. <br>She succumbs to a mysterious illness, leaving it up to you to find a way to help her. <br>Run her apothecary and unravel the source of her malady. <br>On this journey you'll befriend powerful spirits and learn incredible sorceries by calling upon them.<br><br>Can you save her?",
